WEBVTT

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:30.600
Moriyama.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.250
Yes.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:32.800
What is that?

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.120
Potemayo.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:36.990
Pote...?

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:42.910
Very nice, very nice.

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:19.910
Potemayo

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:28.300
Moriyama

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.080
Potato

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.080
Mayonaise

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.590
And that's how she got her name.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.040
No, no, no, no, no.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:41.380
That's not it, Sunao! That's not the important part!

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:43.400
That was an amazing flashback too.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.030
Very nice, very nice.

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:47.970
Good job.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:51.690
Hey Moriyama-kun, can I give her some snacks?

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:58.480
She's like a stuffed animal.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:03:59.410
Yeah!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.470
Hey, come over to me.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.290
No fair!

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.250
This is why girls are so...

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:07.850
Exactly.

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:10.140
They keep saying "cute" over and over.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:13.060
They just have no sense of danger when they don't even know what it is.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:15.890
Let me hold her next!

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:19.370
She's so soft!

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:24.000
Hey...we're still in the middle of class...

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:28.290
Curry Bread

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:35.890
Moriyama Sunao always has bread for lunch.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:41.620
I'll ask him what bread he's ordering and it'll be Mikan's little bit of happiness.

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:46.990
But you know Moriyama-kun, there's a secret item on the menu.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.250
Mikan's Handmade Lunch

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:51.390
It'd be nice if that happens some time!

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:52.410
It's impossible.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:21.920
Translation : Sunao is...

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.440
Translation: Potemayo's...

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.090
Translation : property!

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:29.790
You want tea?

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:34.770
Oh, I see.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.890
It's okay, Potemayo-chan, you don't need to thank me.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:40.810
Sorry, Natsu.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:42.790
Moriyama-kun!

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.830
That was your lunch right?

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:46.590
I'll buy some bread to pay you back.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.690
No! It's okay! It's okay!

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.850
Mikan's Diary - O month X day

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:56.930
Today I was finally able to talk to Moriyama-kun about something other than bread.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:02.550
In memory of today's bento, I'll talk about you to your descendants!

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:06.950
Pick any one you like.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:11.280
I thought I'd buy some for her and bought enough for four.

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:13.700
The one I like...

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:17.730
The one I like the most...

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:00.320
Hey, stop playing around.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.650
It's okay if you understand.

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:09.240
The bread was delicious, Moriyama-kun! It was delicious!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.900
It was delicious!

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:12.900
He's sure popular.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:15.900
That's called being attached.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:28.700
He looked outside as if surprised but had fallen into a nook of the room and fell asleep.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:30.550
Alright, Moriyama.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:31.700
Yes.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:32.840
You read next.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:34.180
Okay.

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:40.580
The next night he played the cello well late into the night too.

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.700
Growing tired, he drank some water.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:45.430
Moriyama-kun...

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:52.350
Moriyama-kun, Moriyama, Moriyama, ...

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.850
Just what is that organism?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.350
Let's go home.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:09.650
Su...Su...nao.

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.030
Su-nao.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:14.420
Sunao.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:18.680
Su-nao.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:21.690
Su-nao.

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:24.140
Su-nao.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:27.030
Suna-o

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.660
She can't say it in one breath?

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.380
Suna-o.

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.880
Welcome, welcome! It's very cheap!

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:39.250
I'm happy I was able to talk so much with Moriyama-kun.

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:37.710
Could I get two daikon's please?

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:40.260
Sure thing! There's a customer, Mikan!

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.550
Thank you very much, God.

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.350
Hey, let's get in the bath.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:54.020
I'll do my best tomorrow too and make lunch.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.370
I wonder what side dishes would be good!?

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:58.440
Hey, Mikan! Are you listening!?

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.980
Egg Rolls

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:08.980
Come on, let's go to sleep.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.220
She wet the bed.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:10.100
Invasion! Mysterious Creature!!

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:13.930
Su-nao.

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:15.720
Su-na-o.

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:18.690
You want me to eat it?

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:39.630
It's not bad.

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:51.610
No, that's enough. Natsu won't have anything left.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:57.120
No! It's okay, Moriyama-kun! Eat, eat! I have another one.

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:00.620
You're a bigger eater than I thought.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:03.710
T-That's not...

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:07.320
I made this for you to eat...

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:11.520
But a big eater...a big eater...

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:16.650
Oh, you big eater, you have some lunch on you.

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:24.680
My gratin and tofu...!

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:26.040
There was chilli shrimp too.

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:27.360
Are you okay, Mikan?

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.190
You're all sticky, Mikan.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:33.010
Ask the swim club later to borrow their shower, okay?

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:36.140
Hey, Potemayo.

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:37.930
That's enough already.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:41.350
It's okay, Moriyama-kun! Eat anything you like!

