00:11:58.850 --> 00:11:59.840
What? A bird?

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:01.640
That was scary...

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.130
Are you okay, Potemayo-chan?

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:13.350
It's a cannibal.

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:16.560
Why are you so...

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.450
Is it a parakeet?

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.030
Or a chick?

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:39.110
So cute!

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:40.660
The bird's on Potemayo!

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:42.190
This might be cute.

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:43.450
Look over here.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.970
Alright, let's start class.

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:55.800
I'll hand back the tests first so come when you're called.

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:57.430
Yes!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:58.370
Abe.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.160
Yes.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:00.020
Arai.

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:00.670
Yes.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:01.610
Ishizaki.

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:02.120
Yes.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:03.130
Inoue.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:03.630
Yes.

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:04.330
Ouka.

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:05.090
Yes.

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:05.760
Kajie.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:07.350
Kasugano.

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:07.810
Yes.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:08.630
Kirihara.

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:09.190
Yes.

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:09.950
Kodama.

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:13.420
Around that time at the Moriyama residence...

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:14.590
This period will be a continuation of last class' outdoor sketching.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:17.170
Don't leave because there's homeroom after.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.540
Okay.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:21.660
Don't leave this park, okay?

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:23.280
Okay.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:38.260
Mudo---

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:49.520
Mudo...

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:54.850
Where should we draw?

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:56.780
Let's see...

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:03.390
Let's draw here. We can use a lot of blue here on our drawings.

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:06.170
We're sketching so we won't be using colours.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.190
What's wrong?

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:15.150
Are you thinking about Moriyama?

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:18.710
T-T-T-That's n-n-not---

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.370
I made some snacks.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:22.290
Good job!

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:23.960
Let's eat while drawing!

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.500
I love the snacks you make, Kyo-chan.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:30.190
The ones from last time were good too. Um...

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:34.960
The guchu balls?

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:36.440
Say truffles!

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.970
Speaking of today's snacks...

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:43.160
Can you tell what's inside?

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.770
We can't tell just by seeing the outside!

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:48.900
Ah, I got it!

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:52.620
Bingo! Today is banana filled guchu balls!!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.450
We didn't answer yet!

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:17.630
What is this!?

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.720
It's not Potemayo-chan.

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:21.440
Is it one of her friends?

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:22.770
So cute.

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.720
Hey, everyone! Come take look!

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:26.980
Come to me, little one!

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.500
Ah! Ei-chan has...!

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:34.620
It ran away!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:45.570
We should decide where to draw now, Mudo.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:46.660
Yeah.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.580
I heard something over here.

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.230
She's not here.

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:53.120
Let's split up and search.

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:53.780
Okay.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:55.370
Then you guys look over there.

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:56.190
Okay.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.020
Hey, where are you going!?

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:04.910
Hey, this is for you!

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:06.690
You can eat them, okay?

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.360
Are you okay, Potemayo-chan?

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:11.720
Hey, wake up!

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.050
Wake up!

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.160
Hey, wake up!

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:37.330
Alright! Were you all able to draw something?

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:38.800
Yes!

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:41.330
Then hand in your sketchbooks.

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:42.770
Yes!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.070
Let's go.

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.790
Your truffles were very good, Kyo-chan!

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.970
I see, then I'll make some for tomorrow.

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:29.100
First!

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:29.740
Second!

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:30.570
Third!

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:34.280
What is this!?

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:35.440
It's a pig! A pig!

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:38.610
I can tell by looking! Why's there a pig here!?

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:39.590
Don't ask me!

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:40.790
What should we do?

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:43.930
Let's tell the teacher first and then call the police.

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:45.170
Shouldn't we tell the nurse too?

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.590
I see! It's good?

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:08.290
I'm happy that you've been making snacks often these days.

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:11.940
And they're always truffles! Are you trying to perfect it?

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:13.980
Something like that.

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:19.690
Where are you going, Kyo-chan?

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:21.550
Just over here.

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:37.790
Hey! Today's strawberry filling!

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:41.590
No need to thank me, Guchuko!

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:45.920
Are you okay!?

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:48.010
Guchuko!

00:21:48.770 --> 00:21:52.290
That name was rejected by all her friends.

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:54.250
She has no sense for it at all.

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:26.610
Next Episode Preview

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:26.610
Next episode preview.

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:29.350
It's sudden but the next story will take place in autumn.

00:23:30.360 --> 00:23:31.410
There's a bath too!

00:23:32.480 --> 00:23:34.770
And Sunao-kun will wear a skirt!

